{"1715590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wizordum", "steam_appid": 1715590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2718420], "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE COMMUNITY</h1><p><br>Join the Wizordum community on <strong></strong>and talk directly with devs and other fans around the world.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ancient Seal of Terrabruma has shattered, unleashing the forces of Chaos once more. As one of the last Mages of Wizordum sanctuary, you must embark on a quest to find the source of this corruption and push the Chaos back before they consume the kingdom in a speedrun-friendly fantasy FPS tearing a page from the spellbooks of ‘90s fantasy FPS classics like Hexen and Heretic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d6ff5346e4a52be12a4aa440ff7014b4.poster.avif?t=1786997680\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d6ff5346e4a52be12a4aa440ff7014b4.webm?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d6ff5346e4a52be12a4aa440ff7014b4.mp4?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/444dfe3bca97f009d8a0ed93c5ad61fd.poster.avif?t=1786997680\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/444dfe3bca97f009d8a0ed93c5ad61fd.webm?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/444dfe3bca97f009d8a0ed93c5ad61fd.mp4?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A vast arsenal of magic weapons &amp; items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Search for secret places filled with treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve puzzles and avoid traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Embark on a single-player campaign to find the source of Chaos, traveling from the Town of Grimbrook through swamps over the snowy mountains and beyond.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect bonus items and beat the hardest difficulty levels to climb to the top of the leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beat challenges at each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compete online for the best time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create and share custom levels, all from inside the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/6703708e603c18f7a498ef9b9b6c1782.poster.avif?t=1786997680\" width=602 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/6703708e603c18f7a498ef9b9b6c1782.webm?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/6703708e603c18f7a498ef9b9b6c1782.mp4?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVEL EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and download custom adventures or full-fledged episodes with the in-game level editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d1b4cba3fe69ec691cd6e8457696d110.poster.avif?t=1786997680\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d1b4cba3fe69ec691cd6e8457696d110.webm?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d1b4cba3fe69ec691cd6e8457696d110.mp4?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ancient Seal of Terrabruma has shattered, unleashing the forces of Chaos once more. As one of the last Mages of Wizordum sanctuary, you must embark on a quest to find the source of this corruption and push the Chaos back before they consume the kingdom in a speedrun-friendly fantasy FPS tearing a page from the spellbooks of ‘90s fantasy FPS classics like Hexen and Heretic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d6ff5346e4a52be12a4aa440ff7014b4.poster.avif?t=1786997680\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d6ff5346e4a52be12a4aa440ff7014b4.webm?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d6ff5346e4a52be12a4aa440ff7014b4.mp4?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/444dfe3bca97f009d8a0ed93c5ad61fd.poster.avif?t=1786997680\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/444dfe3bca97f009d8a0ed93c5ad61fd.webm?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/444dfe3bca97f009d8a0ed93c5ad61fd.mp4?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A vast arsenal of magic weapons &amp; items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Search for secret places filled with treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve puzzles and avoid traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Embark on a single-player campaign to find the source of Chaos, traveling from the Town of Grimbrook through swamps over the snowy mountains and beyond.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect bonus items and beat the hardest difficulty levels to climb to the top of the leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beat challenges at each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compete online for the best time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create and share custom levels, all from inside the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/6703708e603c18f7a498ef9b9b6c1782.poster.avif?t=1786997680\" width=602 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/6703708e603c18f7a498ef9b9b6c1782.webm?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/6703708e603c18f7a498ef9b9b6c1782.mp4?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVEL EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and download custom adventures or full-fledged episodes with the in-game level editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d1b4cba3fe69ec691cd6e8457696d110.poster.avif?t=1786997680\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d1b4cba3fe69ec691cd6e8457696d110.webm?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d1b4cba3fe69ec691cd6e8457696d110.mp4?t=1786997680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Wizordum is a retro FPS that puts you in the role of a Mage on a quest to track down the source of Chaos. With a wide arsenal of spells and magic items, battle your way through the world of Terrabruma in this unique blend of classic 90s shooters and modern gaming elements.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“Can't say enough good things about this game.”<br>Dave Oshry<br><br>“Wizordum is a magical throwback to classic pre-Doom shooters with a fantasy vibe, rich with character and with a perfectly balanced difficulty.”<br>8.5 – Voxel Smash<br><br>“A wholesome wizardy adventure well worth checking out.”<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/header.jpg?t=1786997680", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786997680", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786997680", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Dual-Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 980